      "writtenOn": "2021-09-16T01:47:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Vijay,\nAgree that this approach is a little bit slower as it only runs at 100 KHz. Does your requirement has a strict timing constrains? The benefit of this approach is it can support all the EC chips which also use task-aware i2c driver without touching their drivers.",
      "parentUuid": "120309df_6bb7ed7b",
      "revId": "14e2b9e94d119ff79da8b7597c5c03c8528f4ee2",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
